// Topic: Omitting Namespace (W3Schools cpp_strings_namespace.asp Example 1)
// C++ Equivalent:
//   std::string greeting = "Hello";
//   std::cout << greeting;
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Cluster Primer:
//   Cluster has clean, modern scoping with no boilerplate namespaces needed.
